labels: x | y | z
answer: 15 | 15 | 22
wrong[7 | 15 | 22]: The last line changes `x` again: `z - x` is 22 − 7 = 15.
wrong[8 | 8 | 15]: Line 4, `y += x`, changes `y`: 8 + 7 = 15. Then `z` is 7 + 15 = 22.
