right: `first + " " + last` joins three strings, with the space as a string in the middle. `tag` reuses `full`, so it is right for every name the checks tried.
wrong: Join the pieces with `+` and remember that `+` adds no spaces: `full = first + " " + last`. Then build `tag` from `full`: `"Hello, " + full + "!"`. Use the variables, not one particular name.

